docs {
  # Get Single Stock
  
  Looks up a single stock ticker case-insensitively from the active live list.
  
  **URL**: `GET /stocks/{symbol}` (e.g., `GET /stocks/ali`, `GET /stocks/ali.json`, `GET /stocks/ali.xml`)
  
  **Path Parameters**:
  - `symbol` (required): The stock ticker symbol (e.g. `ALI`, `TEL`, `BDO`).
}
